# Legibility Office n8n Workflows

## Purpose

This directory contains reusable automation workflows for the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS).

The workflows demonstrate how institutional intelligence can be operationalized using open-source workflow automation.

---

# Workflow Categories

## Institutional Intelligence

- Institutional Signal Engine
- Policy Change Detector
- Governance Monitor
- Procurement Risk Monitor
- Institutional Memory Builder

---

## Knowledge Generation

- Research Engine
- Knowledge Graph Builder
- Citation Generator
- Institutional Archive

---

## Public Sector Analytics

- Procurement Dashboard
- Governance Dashboard
- Capability Dashboard
- Digital Public Infrastructure Monitor

---

## AI Governance

- AI Governance Assessment
- Responsible AI Review
- Risk Classification
- Policy Compliance

---

## Communication

- LinkedIn Authority Engine
- Substack Publishing
- Newsletter Automation
- Institutional Comment Engine

---

# Technology

Workflows are compatible with

- n8n
- OpenAI
- PostgreSQL
- Neo4j
- GitHub
- Notion
- Airtable
- Obsidian
- Supabase

